<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Kremlin</p>
<p>Cup men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7) 6-4</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1)</p>
</text>
